The appellant has filed the instant appeal before this Court seeking the following relief(s).
 (i) Admit this appeal;
 (ii) Call for the records of this case and after hearing the parties wou set aside and quash the Impunged Judgment and Award dated 15.07.2022 passe by the Ld. Land Acquisition Judge, West Tripura, at Agartala in case No.Misc. (LA) 24 of 2019;
(iii) Pass any other order/orders as this Hon'ble High Court may consider fit and proper..
[4] The relevant contents of the impugned judgment and order dated 15.07.2022 passed by the learned LA Judge is extracted as under:
"In the result, the application of the referring claimants for enhancement of award is allowed.
